e88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-08T09:39:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T07:40:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable (5e984564c) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 61.61 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs a follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14623 the nodes registered with `GDREGISTER_ABSTRACT_CLASS` and `GDREGISTER_VIRTUAL_CLASS` cannot be inherited by the nodes registered with `GDREGISTER_RUNTIME_CLASS`. The derived nodes cannot be created in the editor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a base class in godot-cpp\n2. Register it with `GDREGISTER_ABSTRACT_CLASS` or `GDREGISTER_VIRTUAL_CLASS`\n3. Create another class that derives from the base class\n4. Register it with `GDREGISTER_RUNTIME_CLASS`\n5. Observe that none of the classes are present in the \"Add Child Node...\" dialog in the editor\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118298/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118298/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}